---
import { 
  Store, 
  CreditCard, 
  PlaneTakeoff, 
  Tent, 
  Headset, 
  BarChart3, 
  Users,
  ArrowRight 
} from "lucide-astro";
---

<section class="py-24 bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark relative overflow-hidden" id="pilares">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-50"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <div class="text-center mb-16 space-y-4">
            <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
                🎯 Infraestructura completa
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-deep-purple dark:text-white">
                Nuestro Ecosistema <span class="gradient-text">Omnicanal</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Todo lo que necesitas para escalar tu negocio desde Colombia hacia el mundo, en una sola membresía. 
                <span class="font-bold text-primary block mt-2">Todo incluido, cero complicaciones.</span>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all card-hover shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl text-center md:text-left">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto md:mx-0 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white transition-all group-hover:scale-110 text-primary">
                    <Store class="w-8 h-8" />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-white flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-2">
                   Crea tu tienda online en minutos
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Personalízala con tu marca. Agrega productos, gestiona pedidos, inventario y supervisa pagos, ventas y logística desde un solo lugar.   
                </p>
                <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                    <a class="text-primary font-medium flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all no-underline" href="#registro">
                        Comenzar ahora <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4" />
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all card-hover shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl text-center md:text-left">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto md:mx-0 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white transition-all group-hover:scale-110 text-primary">
                    <CreditCard class="w-8 h-8" />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-white flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-2">
                    Pagos rápidos y seguros <span class="text-[10px] bg-green-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">Wompi</span>
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                  Pagos ágiles y seguros usando nuestra plataforma aliada Wompi en lo digital y presencial en toda Colombia.                 
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all card-hover shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl text-center md:text-left">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto md:mx-0 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white transition-all group-hover:scale-110 text-primary">
                    <PlaneTakeoff class="w-8 h-8" />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-white">Logística Nacional e Internacional</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Envios urbanos en Colombia, envios a Canada y servicio de Storage.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-4 inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 rounded-full text-xs font-bold">
                    Estamos en Expansión
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="relative group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all card-hover shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl text-center md:text-left overflow-hidden">

    <!-- Badge Próximamente -->
    <div class="absolute top-5 right-5">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-500/20">
            Próximamente
        </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Icono -->
    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mx-auto md:mx-0 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white transition-all group-hover:scale-110 text-primary">
        <Tent class="w-8 h-8" />
    </div>

    <!-- Contenido -->
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-white">
        Festivales Presenciales
    </h3>

    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Participa en nuestros futuros festivales de comercio presencial, conecta tu marca con nuevos clientes y amplía tus oportunidades de venta.
    </p>

    <!-- Ubicación inicial -->
    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap justify-center md:justify-start gap-2">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-lg text-xs font-bold">
            Bogotá
        </span>

        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">
            Próximas ciudades
        </span>
    </div>
</div>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <Headset class="text-primary w-5 h-5" />
                <span class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-slate-300">Soporte 24/7 prioritario</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <BarChart3 class="text-primary w-5 h-5" />
                <span class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-slate-300">Dashboard en tiempo real</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <Users class="text-primary w-5 h-5" />
                <span class="text-sm font-medium dark:text-slate-300">Comunidad privada de pioneros</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .grid-bg {
        background-size: 50px 50px;
        background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(230,0,126,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px), 
                          linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(230,0,126,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
    }
    .card-hover {
        transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }
    .card-hover:hover {
        transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
    }
</style>